ETHICAL USE ADDENDUM (BINDING - koi claim nahi, seedha shart)
=============================================================
Ye ek SECURITY TESTING TOOL hai. Download/install karke tum in shartom se
sahmat ho. In shartom ka ulanghan = license termination (turant):

1. AUTHORIZED TARGETS ONLY
   Sirf un systems par test karo jinpar tumhare paas EXPLICIT, WRITTEN
   authorization hai - bug bounty program scope, SOW, ya owner ka written
   consent. scope.json file tumhara authorization record hai - use sach rakhna
   ZAROORI hai.

2. KABHI MANA HAI:
   - Bina permission kisi bhi system par scan/exploit chalana
   - DoS / resource-exhaustion / brute-force spam
   - Data chori, delete, ya modify karna
   - Tool ko illegal activity ke liye use karna (kisi bhi desh ke law ke against)

3. RESPONSIBILITY
   Har scan ka legal jawabdaar TESTER khud hai. Authors/Contributors ka
   tumhare use se koi responsibility nahi.

4. REPORTING
   Jo vulnerabilities mile, unhe responsibly disclose karo - program ki
   policy ke hisaab se. Data expose na karo, fix hone se pehle public na karo.

5. TERMINATION
   Ye ethical addendum todti hai to MIT license turant khatam.

"Apni machine, apna authorization, apni zimmedari."
